    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guild of Adventurers is open for business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your guild, choose your party, and set out on adventures in an open world full of quirky characters, unique quests, and fun activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure in an Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a densely packed and hand-crafted open world which is designed for adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your journeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find hidden treasure and shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day, you'll have to make camp or return home to resupply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of stronger monsters which come at night!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Party-based Action-RPG Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between your party members to defeat a variety of diverse enemies and execute powerful combos. Each adventurer you recruit and train brings their own unique perks and bonuses for the whole guild!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every townsperson and adventurer has a story to tell! By completing a variety of unique quests, you\u2019ll slowly uncover the stories of each townsperson and bring your adventurers closer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each quest is an adventure, and you\u2019ll have to use your wits. This game does not use quest markers, but you can always consult the local fortune teller for some hints!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Own Guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and manage a roster of over 15 unique adventurers who can be used as part of your party, or assigned to other tasks within the guild.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your guild house to become larger and more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate both the interior and exterior to suit your personality!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax &amp; Get Sidetracked</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is plenty more to do than just fighting monsters and completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy gathering, fishing, crafting and cooking, then get up early for another day of adventurer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guild of Adventurers is open for business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your guild, choose your party, and set out on adventures in an open world full of quirky characters, unique quests, and fun activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure in an Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a densely packed and hand-crafted open world which is designed for adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your journeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find hidden treasure and shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day, you'll have to make camp or return home to resupply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of stronger monsters which come at night!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Party-based Action-RPG Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between your party members to defeat a variety of diverse enemies and execute powerful combos. Each adventurer you recruit and train brings their own unique perks and bonuses for the whole guild!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every townsperson and adventurer has a story to tell! By completing a variety of unique quests, you\u2019ll slowly uncover the stories of each townsperson and bring your adventurers closer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each quest is an adventure, and you\u2019ll have to use your wits. This game does not use quest markers, but you can always consult the local fortune teller for some hints!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Own Guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and manage a roster of over 15 unique adventurers who can be used as part of your party, or assigned to other tasks within the guild.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your guild house to become larger and more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate both the interior and exterior to suit your personality!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax &amp; Get Sidetracked</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is plenty more to do than just fighting monsters and completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy gathering, fishing, crafting and cooking, then get up early for another day of adventurer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "An open world action-RPG where you manage your own adventurer\u2019s guild. Recruit adventurers, fight monsters, complete quests and make friends, all within a vibrant fantasy world!",
